      <span class="responsive-heading__line">Two cultures.</span>
      <span class="responsive-heading__line">One table.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="story__lead">
      NIPO takes its name from <em>Nipo-Brasileiro</em> — the Japanese-Brazilian
      community whose story has shaped life in Brazil for generations.
    </p>
    <p>
      In São Paulo, Japanese precision and respect for ingredients meet Brazilian
      warmth, flavour and hospitality. At NIPO, precise sushi and robata-style cooking
      meet fire-cooked picanha and the generosity of a table made for sharing.
    </p>
    <p class="story__arrival">
      A shared heritage, arriving on Newcastle Quayside on 23rd September.
    </p>
